# spec: drift-kit/SPEC.md §Layout and configuration — this repo's drift-kit consumer knob file; set only what this repo overrides beyond the kit defaults
# spec: drift-kit/SPEC.md §Layout and configuration — DRIFT_KIT_STAGES references lifecycle-kit's LIFECYCLE_KIT_STAGES (the sole roster owner), so the trajectory table renders exactly this repo's live roster; a parallel literal here would reintroduce the roster drift this reference exists to eliminate
DRIFT_KIT_STAGES[] <- LIFECYCLE_KIT_STAGES
# spec: drift-kit/SPEC.md §Layout and configuration — the icebox counterpart of queue-config's and canon-config's section knob; the three are independent by kit and set together by a consumer enabling the tier
DRIFT_KIT_ICEBOX_SECTION = Icebox
# spec: drift-kit/SPEC.md §The price-coverage arm — this repo opts the page half in: the pricing page's markdown form, hashed under its model-pricing heading
DRIFT_KIT_PRICE_PAGE_CMD[] = curl
DRIFT_KIT_PRICE_PAGE_CMD[] = -fsSL
DRIFT_KIT_PRICE_PAGE_CMD[] = https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing.md
DRIFT_KIT_PRICE_PAGE_SECTION = ## Model pricing
